      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（米兰达......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（教授还有大家，每个人都有寄信来，大家都写得好长啊。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（一、二、三......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（还有好几页没看完。呃，怎么还有人把自己的恋爱日记也寄过来了啊！唔哇......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你还在磨蹭什么？要出发了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，我马上就来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（没办法，之后再看好了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（大家都在担心我，但是现在还没有办法回去见大家。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（......我要更努力才行！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_473_mberry_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "薄绿小姐，下午好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "天火学姐！还有桑葚，下午好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "太慢了！怎么这么磨磨蹭蹭的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是，还没有到出发的时间啊......天火学姐怎么看起来一副不耐烦的样子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_473_mberry_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可能是因为我一直在询问天火小姐一些关于维多利亚大学的问题......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸，桑葚对大学的事情感兴趣吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_473_mberry_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是、是的，我听说维多利亚有很厉害的大学，普罗旺斯姐就推荐我来找天火小姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼，普罗旺斯那家伙还真会给我找麻烦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "正好，别看这家伙一脸傻样，她也算是著名教授的得意门生，有什么问题就问她好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊呜天活薛姐卜要恰沃的脸啦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好疼......反对暴力！禁止暴力！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_473_mberry_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，两位看起来关系真好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这叫作指导，不是暴力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行了，不闹了。这次的任务是探测这片山区的地层活动，根据从附近村落收集来的情报，这一带最近时常有地震发生，危险程度很高。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "防护设备都装备好了？好了的话我们就继续向内侧深入。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_473_mberry_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是、是的！我准备好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也没问题！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "希望能采集到好的样本数据......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我警告你，这次可不是什么轻松的任务。你要是再走丢，我可不会去找你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不会不会，怎么会呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，大概不会......吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼，你最好是不会！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，学姐！等等我啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就是这一带了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "从这个洞穴深入的话，应该可以到达我们的目标观测地点。嗯，和之前测算的结果一致！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_473_mberry_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哇，这些都是算出来的吗？果然专业人士就是很厉害啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘿嘿，我这点本事不算什么啦！桑葚你见过艾雅法拉小姐吗？那位才是专家呢！还有地灵前辈也是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#12$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，还有天火学姐！虽然现在是在源石技艺方面更有名，但学姐当年可是跳级拿了多学位的天才哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_473_mberry_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好、好厉害！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "客套话就免了。这附近的样本采集好了？好了的话就去下一个点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说到这个......我刚刚同时用仪器分析了一下采集到的样本，天火学姐，你看这个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "虽然只是初步解析，但能看得出深层的源石活性反应很强烈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_473_mberry_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "深层的源石活性反应......根据我的经验，一般这样的地带都会出现大大小小的灾害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "比如说......地震。而且，这一带的岩层似乎都很疏松，和之前那次也很像......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_473_mberry_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？没、没什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这些都还只是推论，具体分析的话，我还需要更多的数据才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你啊......应该没忘记这次我们是为什么来的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我、我当然知道啦！这都是为了完成探测任务收集的数据嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放心吧，天火学姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......信你一次。那就继续深入吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "学姐，这边的数值也比正常值要高出很多！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，意料之中......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_473_mberry_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这里的结构很稳定，必要的时候可以充当避难所！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "光线和空气都变差了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "小心！前面有感染生物！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼，不过如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_473_mberry_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "天火小姐！下次请不要在这种地方一言不合就使用法术了！这很危险！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊哈哈，学姐还是那么直接......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哇！你们看，那边那个是不是上次博士提过的矿石？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你别乱跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_473_mberry_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "刚刚的是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这里开始不稳定了，我们速战速决！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "刚刚震动的时候监测到的数值......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_473_mberry_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "薄绿小姐......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？啊，我没事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_473_mberry_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这里很难走......两位请小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......等一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_473_mberry_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "天火小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "薄绿——那家伙呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_473_mberry_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#1$1",
