      "speakerName": "焦急的研究者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们出了事之后，教授就带着我们放弃深入，紧急撤离了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的研究者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当时的情况，我们不可能放着你们不管！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是......可是米兰达确实把样本给我了！我明明已经拿到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的研究者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你伤得太重了！我们被困在外面，没法帮你，等救出你的时候，你一直握着拳头......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的研究者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是你的手里......什么也没有抓住......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那个时候，我什么都没能抓住......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "能不能回学校，其实我都无所谓！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是天火学姐，只有这次我不能错过......！如果、如果不能取得最核心的这份数据，那我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那当初坚持勘察，甚至因此得上矿石病的我，还有米兰达，我们到底是为了什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以我必须要去！我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_473_mberry_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "才不是这么一回事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_473_mberry_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是不清楚薄绿小姐过去到底发生了什么，我只知道，现在我们是一个小队！薄绿小姐你不仅代表你自己！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_473_mberry_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不管你的研究有多重要......薄绿小姐！请你更加珍惜你自己！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_473_mberry_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不懂研究......但是，天火小姐拥有这方面的知识，可以帮得上忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_473_mberry_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而我很清楚该如何应对地震后的危险，怎样才能够最大限度地保障两位的安全！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_473_mberry_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果这还不够，罗德岛还有更多值得信赖的前辈......为什么一定要自己一个人扛着呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是，这是我该做的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不管身在何处，不管有怎样的危险，我都会继续这份研究！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“为探寻真理，我甘愿冒任何风险”......在加入教授的研究室时，我就已经发过誓了！所以我必须要......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_473_mberry_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不对！不是这样的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_473_mberry_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我可以理解这是薄绿小姐作为研究者，对真相的探求，但这绝不是——绝对不是薄绿小姐必须承担的义务！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在这一点上，桑葚说得对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "薄绿，教授还有其他人，应该有给你写信吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "教授的......信......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对，信。你今天应该带来了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "难道那些信里没有提到过吗？他们可是因为不放心，连我这边都联系了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "米兰达、米兰达醒过来了......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真的有！真的有米兰达的信！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呜......太、太好了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么在这里哭出来啊，真丢人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么样？就算这样，你还坚持要自己身涉险境吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......我一直觉得，呜哇......是我、是我不好，弄丢了米兰达拼死拿到的样本......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以我必须要......必须要......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_473_mberry_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "感觉是一个很复杂的故事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_473_mberry_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不论如何，薄绿小姐，不要再像这次一样不将自己的安危放在心上了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_473_mberry_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也不可以再像这次一样胡来了！如果有需要，我们......罗德岛的大家都愿意帮忙，一定有办法的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呜呜呜......哇啊......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对不起！对不起！我又让大家担心了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那、那下次还可以继续深入收集地质数据吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_473_mberry_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只、只要措施得当，不随意行动的话......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，别被她骗了，我看她根本没在反省吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“感谢您一直以来的照顾，我会在罗德岛照顾好自己，并且继续研究......”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......好，就这么写吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在这里啊，我找你半天了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "天火学姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "学姐怎么来了？是有什么事吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "之前不是说想要参考文献吗？我去找了点你这个课题方向的论文，还有几篇内容虽然无关，但研究手法我觉得可以参考。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喏，都在这了，你自己挑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "学姐......难道说，是为了我......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "打住！只是查点资料顺带看了看而已，你别......哇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "学姐！你听我说......我做出地质层的深层分析了！呜呜呜！！艾雅法拉小姐也夸奖我了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真的？让我看看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这不是做得很不错嘛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "avg_166_skfire_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你应该不会是又为了数据而冒险了吧？嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没有啦！我有好好申请了任务，和其他干员们一起行动的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我已经想明白了！天火学姐，不论如何，我都会继续做我想做的研究！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我还有很多很多好奇的事，很多很多想要搞明白的现象......不管结果如何我都不会半途而废！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是，我也不想让大家担心，我不会再那样头脑发热啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且，过一段时间我还要去看望一个朋友......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄绿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_388_mint_1#12$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果到时候太没精神或是受了伤，可不好意思去看她呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
